# MadGraph5 batch script: u u~ > u u~ at LO (all orders => QCD gluon exchange).
#
# Why this exact process:
#   - Identical-flavor quark lines: s- and t-channel gluon exchange gives a
#     genuine two-color-flow amplitude (NCOLOR=2), the smallest real test of the
#     multi-flow CF matrix. The colorize + CF pipeline predicts CF = [[9,3],[3,9]]
#     (u u~ > u u~ external color content), the first NCOLOR=2 reference that is
#     generated fresh (rather than borrowed from the pp_to_bb outputs).
#   - One concrete subprocess => the matrix element is matrix1 (no matrix9).
#
# MadEvent output (default), so `launch` builds the helicity-recycled
# matrix1_optim.f for the timing comparison and integrates the partonic cross
# section. lpp=0 => fixed-energy partonic beams (u, u~), so the result is the
# partonic sigma-hat.
generate u u~ > u u~
output uux_to_uux -nojpeg
launch
set lpp1 0
set lpp2 0
set ebeam1 250
set ebeam2 250
set use_syst False
done
